# Files that hand rules to an agent or to contributors. Kept out of the repo on
# purpose: the working agreement here is Matt's to set, not a file's, and one of
# these landing in a clone quietly governs every agent that opens it. Ignored
# rather than merely deleted so `git add .` in any clone cannot bring one back.
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
GEMINI.md
BRANCHING.md
CONVENTIONS.md
.cursorrules
.windsurfrules
.github/copilot-instructions.md
.cursor/
.aider*

# Android companion app build output. The Gradle wrapper (gradlew, gradlew.bat,
# gradle/wrapper/*) is committed on purpose so a clone builds without a local
# Gradle install.
android/build/
android/app/build/
android/.gradle/
android/local.properties
